- **Model materials covered by the upstream DeepSeek model terms:** see
  [`LICENSE-MODEL`](LICENSE-MODEL). Those terms are distinct from MIT.
- **Third-party components, datasets, model weights and copied materials:** their
  own license/notices control.
- **Fork-specific documentation and other original contributions:** copyright
